### =========================================================
### TPI Food Store — Auth y usuarios
### Requiere: python -m app.db.seed  (crea admin / Admin1234!)
### =========================================================
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Registro público -> 201, role "user"
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "uriel", "full_name": "Uriel Palma", "email": "uriel@test.com", "password": "secreto123" }

### 2. Username repetido -> 409
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "uriel", "full_name": "Otro", "email": "otro@test.com", "password": "secreto123" }

### 3. Email repetido -> 409
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "otro", "full_name": "Otro", "email": "uriel@test.com", "password": "secreto123" }

### 4. Datos inválidos (email mal, contraseña corta) -> 422
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ab", "full_name": "", "email": "no-es-email", "password": "123" }

### 5. Login con contraseña incorrecta -> 401
POST {{base}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=uriel&password=incorrecta

### 6. Login como user -> 200 {"message": "Login exitoso"} + Set-Cookie HttpOnly
POST {{base}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=uriel&password=secreto123

### 7. Perfil -> 200 UserPublic (sin hashed_password)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### 8. Listado de usuarios como user -> 403
GET {{base}}/admin/usuarios

### 9. Login como admin
POST {{base}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=Admin1234!

### 10. Listado de usuarios -> 200
GET {{base}}/admin/usuarios

### 11. Desactivar al usuario 2 -> 200, disabled: true (repetirlo también da 200)
POST {{base}}/admin/usuarios/2/desactivar

### 12. Desactivarse a sí mismo (admin = id 1) -> 400
POST {{base}}/admin/usuarios/1/desactivar

### 13. Usuario inexistente -> 404
POST {{base}}/admin/usuarios/999/activar

### 14. Login del usuario desactivado -> 400 "Cuenta de usuario desactivada"
POST {{base}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=uriel&password=secreto123

### 15. Volver a iniciar como admin y activar al usuario 2 -> 200, disabled: false
POST {{base}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=Admin1234!

###
POST {{base}}/admin/usuarios/2/activar

### 16. Logout -> 200 y la cookie se borra
POST {{base}}/auth/logout

### 17. Perfil sin sesión -> 401
GET {{base}}/auth/me